%% Lab 03: one turn on a thread. The checkpointer loads and saves the thread; a hook decides what the model is sent.
%% Export: npx -y @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli -i lab03_thread_turn.mmd -o lab03_thread_turn.png -b white -s 2
sequenceDiagram
    participant Rep as Support rep
    participant Code as Your code<br>(create_agent)
    participant Saver as Checkpointer
    participant Model as Model<br>(OpenAI)

    Rep->>Code: new message + thread_id
    Code->>Saver: load the thread for this thread_id
    Saver-->>Code: every earlier message
    Note over Code,Saver: before_model hook: all messages (full),<br>the newest ones (trim) or a summary
    Code->>Model: system prompt + chosen messages
    Model-->>Code: reply (or a tool call first)
    Code->>Saver: save the new messages (checkpoint)
    Code-->>Rep: reply
